# PODACHI Platform — Environment Configuration Template
# Production deployment requires Supabase credentials.
# In development/demo mode, Podachi runs an advanced client-side secure simulation engine.

# Supabase Project Configuration
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here

# Security Notice:
# NEVER expose SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to frontend environment variables or browser bundles.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-for-server-only
